Sol Next is a brand-new, independent, next-generation Android 10-16/17 & HarmonyOS
multimodal AI OS Agent built with a Rust native JNI kernel (16KB page-aligned),
Dawn Orbit 4-screen voice+text UI, 20-language phone-language auto-localization,
free built-in Rust-encrypted DeepSeek V4.1 Flash + universal BYOK, Wi-Fi-off
persistent Wireless Debugging Shell Helper, multi-stream accelerated OTA updates
with release notes, 1:1 physical-DPI background VirtualDisplay, carrier-grade AI
calling, and zero-dependency CLI + stdio MCP Server integration.
